 on Video Combine to get the best results\nAlso u can generate with 121 length and set 24 frame_rate, but u get a longer generation\n\nU can try generate in 720p (1280x720), but it takes more time\nalso try use different preprocessors (mostly DWPreprocessor, DepthAnythingPreprocessor, CannyEdgePreprocessor)\n\nuse CFG 1.0 to get faster generation or use CFG 2.0 to get more cool result, but generation takes more time if cfg>1. With CFG 2.0 u necessarily write negative prompt (cfg 1 doesn't reqiuere negative prompt)\n\nRecomended resolution: 1024x576, 576x1024, 1280x720, 720x1280\n\nHow to set length (frames) correctly:\n\nfor 16 fps\n16 * number of seconds = length and set frame_rate 16 on Video Combine\n\nfor 24 fps\n24 * number of seconds = length and set frame_rate 24 on Video Combine\n\nU can generate videos more than 5 seconds because u have more sources (video and image)\n\nI recomend leave 8 steps with 4steps loras, but u can try set 10 steps - you may get better result\n\nTry adjusting WanVideoBlockSwap settings\n\nMy results with rtx 5080 generation\n\nWith 4steps loras\n576p, light Lora 250928, 81 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 5-6 minutes\n720p, light Lora 250928, 81 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 10-11 minutes\n576p, light Lora 250928, 129 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 8 minutes\n720p, light Lora 250928, 129 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 15-16 minutes\n\nWithout LightX\n480p, 81 length (16 fps), 20 steps, unipc, cfg 3.5 ≈ 10 minutes\n720p, 81 length (16 fps), 30 steps, unipc, cfg 3.5 ≈ 35 minutes"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":226,"type":"Label (rgthree)","pos":[-951.8441836419244,161.84826843407023],"size":[625.65234375,24],"flags":{"allow_interaction":true},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Just connect UNETLoaderDisTorch2 to Power Lora Loader","properties":{"fontSize":24,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontCol